{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and motion capabilities, separating sensing outcomes from motion commands. The specification binds each perception outcome to a safe, coverage-oriented action, enforcing conservative recovery only when needed and rapid return to exploration. Recovery states are one-shot and do not allow forward/random_walk until path_clear. Full_rotate is only used after repeated recovery failures.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate perception (sensor) and motion (actuator) into distinct plant automata for clarity and modularity.",
    "Specification automata bind each sensor outcome to a unique, safe controllable action, enforcing conservative recovery and rapid return to exploration after clearance."
  ],
